[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":92},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"item",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-5,"_20":21,"_22":23,"_24":25,"_26":27,"_28":-5,"_29":30,"_31":25,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":41,"_42":-5,"_41":43,"_44":45,"_46":-5,"_47":-5,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":55,"_56":57,"_58":59,"_60":39,"_61":62,"_63":-5,"_64":39,"_65":66},"id","vh4yrdkp4e3xkhkybhrlqu8g5","revision",1,"title","卖家谈Prime Day限购与跨平台趋势","originalTitle","I don’t and can’t condone using multiple amazon accounts to get around quantity limits, it’s just unnecessary risk on your seller account.","summary","我不支持也无法认可利用多个亚马逊账号绕过数量限制，这对你的卖家账号来说纯属不必要的风险。\n\n但天哪，今天有些优惠我恨不得买10,000件，结果只能买到300-400件。\n\n就我个人而言，Prime Day第二天的表现比第一天更明显。\n\n看到 @FlipAlert 团队单日支出超过 $500,000 真是厉害 👑\n\n今年从亚马逊到沃尔玛的迁移现象很多，比我记忆中以往促销期间都要多。","reason","source",{"_9":85,"_86":87,"_88":89,"_90":39,"_91":-5},"links",{"_82":83,"_66":84},"publishedAt","2026-10-07T21:07:56.000Z","publishedPrecision","timestamp","calendarDate","discoveredAt","2026-10-17T15:58:17.548Z","timelineAt","category","advertising","tags",[80,81],"score",15,"selected",false,"channel","x","story",{"_71":72,"_73":51,"_74":75,"_76":77,"_78":-5,"_44":79},"media",[],"byline","detailedGuide","readingMode","full","author","SaulSellsStuff","language","en","body",{"_67":-5,"_66":68,"_69":-5,"_70":62},"outline",[],"relatedStories",[],"indexable","markdownAvailable",true,"group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","original","zh","<p>I don’t and can’t condone using multiple amazon accounts to get around quantity limits, it’s just unnecessary risk on your seller account.</p><p>But man there are some deals today I’d buy 10,000 of in a heartbeat and all I could get was 300-400.</p><p>Day two of prime day is showing up a bit more than day one for me personally.</p><p>Still seeing over $500,000 in spend in one day from the @FlipAlert folks is 👑</p><p>Lots of Amazon to Walmart happening this year, more than I recall on previous sales.</p>","zhKind","complete","authorName","Saul","handle","avatarUrl","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","avatarSrcSet","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 48w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 96w","quoted",[],"广告/运营","亚马逊","aihot","/items/vh4yrdkp4e3xkhkybhrlqu8g5","https://x.com/SaulSellsStuff/status/2107941014476386369","x-saul-sells-stuff","name","X · Saul","kind","x_search","firstParty","iconUrl",{"_93":94},"changelogVersion","2026-10-09T22:08"]
